        "title": "Express Length in Terms of Width",
        "text": "Let the width = $x$ metres\n\nFencing used: $2x$ (two widths) + length\n\nTotal fencing = 120m\n\nSo: $2x + \\text{length} = 120$\n\nLength $= 120 - 2x$",
